SUMMARY:Life Skills Cafe' - NOVEMBER
LOCATION:Children's Museum of Acadiana\, 201 E Congress St\, Lafayette
DESCRIPTION:🔥🚒 LIFE SKILLS CAFÉ: PRACTICE SAFETY THROUGH FUN! 🎨
 🧯\nWho says learning about fire safety can't be CREATIVE\, COLORFUL\, a
 nd FUN?! Join us for November's Functional Life Skills Café as we turn im
 portant safety lessons into hands-on activities\, art projects\, and excit
 ing adventures! ❤️\nThis month\, we're becoming FIRE SAFETY DETECTIVES
 ! 🔍🔥\nHere's what's in store:\n🔎 Fire Safety Scavenger Hunt: Sear
 ch for and identify important fire safety items and features.\n🏡 Build 
 Your Own Safe Space: Create an art project showing safe exits\, smoke alar
 ms\, and designated family meeting spots.\n🎨 Flames of Safety: Get crea
 tive with colorful mixed-media artwork featuring important fire safety mes
 sages.\n🚒 What Would You Do? Practice real-life fire safety scenarios a
 nd learn how to make safe choices during an emergency.\n🦸 My Safety Sup
 erpower: Wrap up with a fun activity celebrating all the new safety skills
  we've learned!\nThis isn't just an art class—it's an opportunity to pra
 ctice important life skills\, build confidence\, and learn how to stay saf
 e in an emergency. And the best part? We get to CREATE while we LEARN!\n
 📅 Monday\, November 30\, 2026\n⏰ 6:00–7:30 PM\n📍 Children's Muse
 um of Acadiana\n👥 Ages 8+ (including adults!)\n💙 Our Functional Life
  Skills Café is designed for individuals of all exceptionalities. We beli
 eve everyone deserves opportunities to learn practical skills\, build inde
 pendence\, and gain confidence in a fun and supportive environment.\nCome 
 ready to explore\, create\, discover\, and become a Fire Safety Superhero!
  🦸‍♀️🔥\nLearn • Practice • Create • Grow\nRegistration i
 s required. We can't wait to see you there! ❤️\n\nhttps://happeningnex
 t.com/event/life-skills-cafe-november-eid3a0e9rc3pf
